# Haiku
@bart should we add Haiku 5.5 to the models?
bart> It would make the cheap tier faster. Want a plan for it?

# Concision in Agent Responses
@brainstorm 
bart> Want to pick up Bart's voice or the auto-collapse change?
@bart I want to talk about bart's voice
bart> What would you want it to do when you're wrong?
@bart I would want it to push back politely, maybe point out the good and then the bad
bart> Both may hold: the praise softens it, but it also delays the point.
@bart Just point out whats wrong first
bart> That's clear.

